  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are attuned to the Vitality or Void as a trait from your Drachiri Benefactor, and you can cast spells with the Healing trait that have either type of healing.</p><hr><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You apply the manipulation of life and death as part of your use of healing magic. Spells you can cast with the healing trait gain the Drachiri trait, allowing you to replace the type of healing to that of your selected trait.</span></p>"
